    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaba yiminyaka emithathu kungekho ukulwa phakathi kweSiriya loIsrayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.18.2+2CH.18.3+2CH.18.4+2CH.18.5+2CH.18.6+2CH.18.7+2CH.18.8+2CH.18.9+2CH.18.10+2CH.18.11+2CH.18.12+2CH.18.13+2CH.18.14+2CH.18.15+2CH.18.16+2CH.18.17+2CH.18.18+2CH.18.19+2CH.18.20+2CH.18.21+2CH.18.22+2CH.18.23+2CH.18.24+2CH.18.25+2CH.18.26+2CH.18.27+2CH.18.28+2CH.18.29+2CH.18.30+2CH.18.31+2CH.18.32+2CH.18.33+2CH.18.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Lan 18:2–34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa ngomnyaka wesithathu uJehoshafati inkosi yakoJuda wafika enkosini yakoIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yakoIsrayeli yathi encekwini zayo: Liyazi ukuthi iRamothi‐Gileyadi lingelethu, kodwa siphongukuhlala nje, singalithathi enkosini yaseSiriya na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yasisithi kuJehoshafati: Uzaphuma lami ukuyakulwa eRamothi‐Gileyadi na? UJehoshafati wathi kuyo: Okwami ngokwakho, lami uqobo labantu bami kanye lamabhiza ami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehoshafati wasesithi enkosini yakoIsrayeli: Akubuze eNkosini uNkulunkulu kuqala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yakoIsrayeli yasibuthanisa abaprofethi ababengamakhulu amane, yathi kubo: Ngiyehlasela iRamothi‐Gileyadi kumbe ngingayi na? Bona bathi: Hamba, ngoba iNkosi izalinikela esandleni sakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehoshafati wasesithi: Kakukho yini lapha omunye umprofethi weNkosi uNkulunkulu esingambuza na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yakoIsrayeli yathi kuye: Kusekhona omunye umuntu esingabuza ngaye eNkosini uNkulunkulu, nguMikaya indodana kaImla, kodwa kangimthandi ngoba kazake akhulume okuhle ngami, uhlala ekhuluma okubi. UJehoshafati wathi: Nkosi, ungatsho njalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yakoIsrayeli yasibiza induna yathi kuyo: Ngilethela masinyane uMikaya indodana kaImla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yakoIsrayeli loJehoshafati inkosi yakoJuda babehlezi ezihlalweni zabo zobukhosi, begqoke izambatho zabo zobukhosi, besesizeni ngasesangweni leSamariya, bonke abaprofethi babeprofetha phambi kwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UZedekiya indodana kaKenana wazenzela impondo zensimbi, wathi kuAhabi: INkosi ithi: Ngalezimpondo uzahlaba amaSiriya uze uwaqede. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labo bonke abaprofethi batsho njalo, bathi: Hamba uyenqoba iRamothi‐Gileyadi, iNkosi izalinikela esandleni sakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isithunywa esasiyebiza uMikaya sathi kuye: Amazwi abaprofethi ayathandeka wonke enkosini; lelizwi lakho kalifane lawabo, ukhulume okuthandekayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uMikaya wathi: Ngifunga iNkosi uNkulunkulu, lokho iNkosi ekutshoyo kimi ngizakukukhuluma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esefikile enkosini uAhabi, inkosi yathi kuye: Mikaya, siyehlasela iRamothi‐Gileyadi kumbe singayi na? Yena wathi kuyo: Hambani, lizanqoba; iNkosi izanikela iRamothi‐Gileyadi ezandleni zenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa inkosi uAhabi yathi kuye: Ngizakukufungisa kuze kube kangaki ukuba ungitshele iqiniso lodwa ebizweni leNkosi uNkulunkulu na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wathi: Ngabona uIsrayeli wonke echithekile phezu kwezintaba njengezimvu ezingelamalusi; iNkosi yathi: Laba kabalamkhokheli, kabazibuyelele kuhle emakhaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nani 27:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.9.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 9:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.6.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mark 6:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yakoIsrayeli yasisithi kuJehoshafati: Kangikutshelanga yini ukuthi kayikukhuluma okuhle ngami kodwa okubi kuphela na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMikaya wasesithi: Zwaninike ilizwi leNkosi uNkulunkulu. Ngayibona ihlezi esihlalweni sayo sobukhosi, lexuku lonke lasezulwini limi phansi kwayo ngakwesokunene langakwesokhohlo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iNkosi yathi: Ngubani ozakhohlisa uAhabi ukuba ahambe ayefela eRamothi‐Gileyadi na? Omunye watsho okunye, lomunye okunye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwasekuphuma umoya, wema phambi kweNkosi wathi: Ngizamkhohlisa mina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi kuye: Kanjani na? Yena wathi: Ngizahamba ngibe ngumoya wokuqamba amanga emilonyeni yabo bonke abaprofethi bakhe. INkosi yathi: Impela uzamkhohlisa; hambake wenze njalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke iNkosi ifakile umoya wokuqamba amanga emilonyeni yalabaprofethi bakho, ngoba iNkosi ikumisele okubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UZedekiya indodana kaKenana wasesondela, wawakala uMikaya esihlathini, wathi: Umoya weNkosi uNkulunkulu wasuka njani kimi ukuyakhuluma kuwe na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMikaya wathi: Wena uqobo uzakukubona lokhu mhla ubalekela ezindlini ezingaphakathi ukuyacatsha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yakoIsrayeli yalaya ukuba uMikaya abanjwe, asiwe kuAmoni umbusi womuzi lakuJowashi indodana yenkosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yathi: Valelani lumuntu entolongweni, limnike ukudla lamanzi alutshwana ngize ngibuye kuhle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMikaya wathi: Uba ubuya kuhle, iNkosi izabe ingakhulumanga ngami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yakoIsrayeli loJehoshafati inkosi yakoJuda baphuma baya eRamothi‐Gileyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yakoIsrayeli yathi kuJehoshafati: Mina ngizazifihla, ngingene ekulweni, kodwa wena gqoka izambatho zakho zobukhosi. Inkosi yakoIsrayeli yasizifihla, yangena ekulweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yaseSiriya yayilayile izinduna zenqola zayo zokulwa ezingamatshumi amathathu lambili, yathi: Lingalwi lamuntu, lilwe lenkosi yakoIsrayeli kuphela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi induna zezinqola zokulwa zibona uJehoshafati zathi: Yiyo le sibili inkosi yakoIsrayeli. Zasezimsukela, yena wahlaba umkhosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho izinduna zezinqola zokulwa zibona ukuba kwakungesiyo inkosi yakoIsrayeli, zayekela ukuxotshana laye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuntu othile watshoka umtshoko wakhe engananzelele, wahlaba inkosi yakoIsrayeli ngaphansi kwesivikelo sesifuba; yasisithi kumtshayeli wenqola yayo yokulwa: Phenduka, ungikhuphe phakathi kokulwa’ ngoba sengilimele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukulwa kwaba nzima mhlalokho; inkosi yayisekelwe enqoleni yayo yokulwa ikhangele amaSiriya, yafa ntambama; igazi lenxeba layo lagelezela ngaphansi kwenqola yokulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekutshoneni kwelanga kwamenyezwa kuyo yonke impi kwathiwa: Bonke abantu kababuyele emizini yakibo, bonke babuyele emazweni akibo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngoba inkosi isifile. Bayiletha eSamariya, bayingcwabela khona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inqola yokulwa bayigezisa ngasechibini leSamariya, izinja zakhotha igazi layo, lamawule ageza ngalo, njengokutsho kwelizwi leNkosi uNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezinye indaba zikaAhabi, lakho konke akwenzayo, langendlu yempondo zendlovu ayakhayo, langemizi yonke ayakhayo, kulotshiwe ogwalweni lwezindaba zamakhosi akoIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAhabi waya kwabaphansi. UAhaziya indodana yakhe waba yinkosi esikhundleni sakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehoshafati indodana kaAsa waba yinkosi yakoJuda ngomnyaka wesine wokubusa kukaAhabi inkosi yakoIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehoshafati wayeseleminyaka engamatshumi amathathu lanhlanu lapho eqalisa ukubusa; wabusa eJerusalema iminyaka engamatshumi amabili lanhlanu. Ibizo likanina lalinguAzuba indodakazi kaShilihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walandela zonke indlela zikaAsa uyise, kaphambukanga kuzo, wenza okulungileyo phambi kweNkosi. Kodwa indawo eziphakemeyo zokukhonzela kazivalwanga; abantu babelokhu benikela imihlatshelo, betshisa impepha endaweni eziphakemeyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehoshafati wahlalisana ngokuthula lenkosi yakoIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezinye indaba zikaJehoshafati, lobuqhawe bakhe, lokulwa kwakhe kulotshiwe ogwalweni lwezindaba zamakhosi akoJuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waqeda elizweni amadoda ayengamawule emathempelini ayesele ensukwini zikayise uAsa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakungelankosi eEdoma, kwakukhona umbambeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehoshafati wenza imikolo emikhulu yokuthwala impahla ukuyathwala igolide eOfiri; kodwa kayifikanga yephukela eEziyoni‐Geberi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAhaziya indodana kaAhabi wathi kuJehoshafati: Inceku zami kazihambe lezakho emikolweni. Kodwa uJehoshafati kavumanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehoshafati waya kwabaphansi, wangcwatshelwa kuboyise emzini kaDavida ukhokho wakhe. UJoramu indodana yakhe waba yinkosi esikhundleni sakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAhaziya indodana kaAhabi waba yinkosi koIsrayeli eSamariya ngomnyaka wetshumi lesikhombisa wokubusa kukaJehoshafati inkosi yakoJuda; wabusa uIsrayeli iminyaka emibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenza okubi phambi kweNkosi, walandela indlela zikayise, lendlela zikanina, lendlela zikaJerobowamu indodana kaNebati owenza uIsrayeli one. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakhonza ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", wakhuleka kuye, wayithukuthelisa iNkosi, uNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli njengokwenza konke kukayise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
